@startuml
title KodaMate - Sequence ecran accueil

actor Utilisateur
participant "App MAUI\n(HomePage)" as App
participant "Distributeur API\nFastAPI" as API
participant "Open-Meteo API" as Meteo

Utilisateur -> App: Ouvrir Accueil
App -> API: GET /api/settings
API --> App: etat, name, langue, caractere...
App -> Meteo: GET /v1/forecast
Meteo --> App: temperature, humidite, vent
App --> Utilisateur: Afficher etat reseau + meteo + localisation
@enduml

